Z||000006||Slammed Fiero||08-29-2001||09:13 PM||||ahh Urchin<P>Ontario has quite a contigent of Solo 1 and 2 events.<P>I'm taking the Fiero to shannonville on September 5th for lapping , there's the ontario regionals held at CFB mountianview in picton (airstrip) , There's lots of stuff put on by the Corvette clubs in Toronto as well as the Rx7 and miata clubs.<P>Oshawa has lots of events. It's a bitof a drive , but still worth it. <P><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals, White face Gauges , 70Hp Shot of NOS Autocrossed , Tracked , Dragged? (soon) abused.||||reg||1
